                                                                    <section class="home-stats stats gray-bg block">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="block-container">
                            <h3 class="bar-heading blue-border">Why Choose Gordon State College?</h3>
                            <div class="stats-container">
                                                            <div class="single-stat blue-border">
                                                                <div class="stat-icon">
                                                <span aria-label="Student-to-Professor Ratio " class="gs-black-board"></span></div>
                        <div class="stat-number blue">21:1</div>
                        <div class="stat-description">Student-to-Professor Ratio </div>
                    </div>
                                                            <div class="single-stat blue-border">
                                                                <div class="stat-icon">
                                                <span aria-label="Current Enrollment" class="gs-group"></span></div>
                        <div class="stat-number blue">3,500</div>
                        <div class="stat-description">Current Enrollment</div>
                    </div>
                                                            <div class="single-stat blue-border">
                                                                <div class="stat-icon">
                                                <span aria-label="Study Options" class="gs-diploma"></span></div>
                        <div class="stat-number blue">20+</div>
                        <div class="stat-description">Study Options</div>
                    </div>
                                                            <div class="single-stat blue-border">
                                                                <div class="stat-icon">
                                                <span aria-label="Ways to get involved" class="gs-bullhorn-megaphone"></span></div>
                        <div class="stat-number blue">100+</div>
                        <div class="stat-description">Ways to get involved</div>
                    </div>
                                </div>
                            <p>Gordon State offers classes at two physical campuses and online. Our main campus is located in Barnesville, Georgia, boasts two different styles of housing options, multiple dining options, and state of the art classrooms and academic buildings, equipped with the latest technology to assist in your studies. We also offer classes at our McDonough location.</p>
                        </div>
        </div>
    </section>
